 const licenseQualityBatch2=[["A fasting serum glucose result is unexpectedly low after delayed sample separation. What is the likely cause?","नमुना छुट्याउन ढिलो हुँदा fasting serum glucose अप्रत्याशित रूपमा कम आयो। सम्भावित कारण के हो?",["Ongoing glycolysis by blood cells","Increased serum albumin","Clot retraction","Light exposure only"],0,"Blood cells continue consuming glucose after collection; prompt separation or an appropriate glycolysis inhibitor is needed.","रगतका कोषले संकलनपछि पनि glucose प्रयोग गरिरहन्छन्; त्यसैले छिटो serum छुट्याउनुपर्छ वा उपयुक्त inhibitor चाहिन्छ।","Clinical Biochemistry"],["A patient has increased urea and creatinine. Which system is most directly being assessed?","बिरामीको urea र creatinine बढेको छ। कुन प्रणालीको मूल्याङ्कन भइरहेको छ?",["Renal function","Thyroid function","Pancreatic function","Coagulation"],0,"Urea and creatinine are commonly used, with clinical context and other tests, to assess renal function.","Urea र creatinine अन्य परीक्षण तथा clinical अवस्थासँगै renal function मूल्याङ्कन गर्न प्रयोग हुन्छन्।","Clinical Biochemistry"],["Which condition is most likely to produce a prolonged PT with a relatively normal aPTT?","कुन अवस्थामा PT लामो तर aPTT तुलनात्मक रूपमा सामान्य हुन सक्छ?",["Early vitamin K deficiency affecting factor VII","Severe haemophilia A","Heparin contamination","Factor VIII deficiency"],0,"Factor VII has a short half-life, so early vitamin K deficiency or warfarin effect may prolong PT first.","Factor VII को half-life छोटो हुन्छ; त्यसैले vitamin K कमी वा warfarin प्रभावमा सुरुमा PT बढ्न सक्छ।","Haematology"],["A blood film shows sickle-shaped erythrocytes. Which haemoglobin is associated with this disorder?","Blood film मा sickle आकारका RBC देखिए। कुन haemoglobin यस रोगसँग सम्बन्धित छ?",["HbS","HbA2 only","HbF only","HbC only"],0,"Sickle cell disease is associated with haemoglobin S caused by a beta-globin gene variant.","Sickle cell disease beta-globin gene परिवर्तनका कारण बन्ने haemoglobin S सँग सम्बन्धित हुन्छ।","Haematology"],["Which anticoagulant is preferred for routine coagulation tests such as PT and aPTT?","PT र aPTT जस्ता coagulation test का लागि कुन anticoagulant उपयुक्त हुन्छ?",["3.2% sodium citrate","EDTA","Sodium fluoride","Lithium heparin"],0,"Citrate binds calcium reversibly and is used in correctly filled coagulation tubes at the specified blood-to-anticoagulant ratio.","Citrate ले calcium लाई reversible रूपमा बाँध्छ; coagulation tube तोकिएको अनुपातमा भर्नुपर्छ।","Haematology"],["A patient has eosinophilia and a history of helminth exposure. Which investigation may help identify the cause?","बिरामीमा eosinophilia छ र helminth exposure को इतिहास छ। कारण पत्ता लगाउन कुन परीक्षण उपयोगी हुन सक्छ?",["Stool examination for ova and parasites","Serum sodium only","Bleeding time","Blood glucose only"],0,"Stool microscopy or other parasite-specific tests may help, depending on the suspected organism and its life cycle.","शंका गरिएको parasite र यसको जीवनचक्रअनुसार stool microscopy वा विशेष परीक्षण उपयोगी हुन सक्छ।","Clinical Parasitology"],["Which specimen is preferred for culture in suspected bacterial meningitis, when clinically indicated and safely collected?","Bacterial meningitis शंका हुँदा, चिकित्सकीय रूपमा उपयुक्त र सुरक्षित अवस्थामा culture का लागि कुन नमुना लिइन्छ?",["Cerebrospinal fluid","Hair clipping","Nail scraping","Stool only"],0,"CSF is a key specimen for meningitis investigation; collection and urgent transport must follow clinical protocols.","Meningitis जाँचमा CSF मुख्य नमुना हो; संकलन र तुरुन्त ढुवानी clinical protocol अनुसार गर्नुपर्छ।","Bacteriology"],["A urine culture grows mixed organisms from a poorly collected sample. What is the most likely interpretation?","राम्ररी संकलन नगरिएको urine sample मा धेरै प्रकारका organism बढे। सम्भावित व्याख्या के हो?",["Possible contamination; correlate and recollect if indicated","Definite bloodstream infection","Always a pure urinary pathogen","Proof of kidney failure"],0,"Mixed growth in a poorly collected specimen may reflect contamination; interpret with symptoms and collection quality.","राम्ररी नलिइएको नमुनामा mixed growth contamination हुन सक्छ; लक्षण र नमुना गुणस्तर हेर्नुपर्छ।","Bacteriology"],["Which test helps distinguish Staphylococcus aureus from many coagulase-negative staphylococci?","Staphylococcus aureus लाई धेरै coagulase-negative staphylococci बाट छुट्याउन कुन test उपयोगी हुन्छ?",["Coagulase test","Oxidase test","Urease test only","Bile solubility"],0,"S. aureus is typically coagulase-positive, whereas most common coagulase-negative staphylococci are negative.","S. aureus सामान्यतया coagulase-positive हुन्छ; धेरै coagulase-negative staphylococci negative हुन्छन्।","Bacteriology"],["Which fungal infection is commonly associated with budding yeast cells and pseudohyphae on microscopy?","Microscopy मा budding yeast र pseudohyphae देखिने सामान्य fungal infection कुन हो?",["Candidiasis","Dermatophytosis only","Aspergillosis only","Mucormycosis only"],0,"Candida species may show budding yeast and pseudohyphae, depending on species and conditions.","Candida species मा species र अवस्थाअनुसार budding yeast र pseudohyphae देखिन सक्छन्।","Mycology"],["Which antibody class is most abundant in normal human serum?","सामान्य मानव serum मा सबैभन्दा बढी पाइने antibody class कुन हो?",["IgG","IgE","IgD","IgM"],0,"IgG is the predominant immunoglobulin class in serum and is important in secondary immune responses.","Serum मा IgG सबैभन्दा बढी हुन्छ र secondary immune response मा महत्वपूर्ण हुन्छ।","Immunology"],["In histopathology, why is a tissue section floated on a warm water bath before mounting?","Histopathology मा mounting अघि tissue section लाई न्यानो water bath मा किन राखिन्छ?",["To flatten wrinkles and folds","To decalcify bone","To fix tissue permanently","To remove all stain"],0,"A warm flotation bath helps sections spread and reduces folds before they are picked up on slides.","न्यानो पानीमा section फैलिन्छ र slide मा राख्नुअघि चाउरी कम हुन्छ।","Histopathology"],["Which stain is commonly used to demonstrate collagen in connective tissue?","Connective tissue मा collagen देखाउन कुन stain सामान्यतया प्रयोग हुन्छ?",["Masson's trichrome","Ziehl–Neelsen","Gram stain","India ink"],0,"Masson's trichrome differentiates collagen from muscle and other tissue components.","Masson's trichrome ले collagen लाई muscle र अन्य tissue component बाट छुट्याउन मद्दत गर्छ।","Histopathology"],["Which heart chamber pumps deoxygenated blood to the lungs?","Deoxygenated blood फोक्सोतर्फ पठाउने मुटुको कुन chamber हो?",["Right ventricle","Left ventricle","Left atrium","Right atrium"],0,"The right ventricle pumps deoxygenated blood through the pulmonary artery to the lungs.","Right ventricle ले pulmonary artery मार्फत deoxygenated blood फोक्सोमा पठाउँछ।","Anatomy and Physiology"],["Which parasite is commonly identified by the presence of a large operculated egg in stool?","Stool मा ठूलो operculated egg देखिँदा कुन parasite को सम्भावना हुन्छ?",["Fasciola species","Enterobius vermicularis","Ascaris lumbricoides","Ancylostoma duodenale"],0,"Fasciola eggs are large and operculated; identification should consider morphology and exposure history.","Fasciola का अण्डा ठूला र operculated हुन्छन्; morphology र exposure history पनि विचार गर्नुपर्छ।","Parasitology"],["A laboratory centrifuge vibrates excessively during operation. What should the operator do first?","Centrifuge चल्दा धेरै vibration आयो। Operator ले पहिले के गर्नुपर्छ?",["Stop the run safely and check load balance and rotor condition","Open the lid while spinning","Increase speed immediately","Hold the centrifuge by hand"],0,"Stop the centrifuge safely; inspect balancing, tube integrity and rotor according to the manufacturer's instructions.","Centrifuge सुरक्षित रूपमा रोक्नुहोस्; balance, tube र rotor निर्माता निर्देशनअनुसार जाँच्नुहोस्।","Instrumentation and Automation"],["Before issuing a crossmatch-compatible blood unit, which patient identification step is essential?","Crossmatch compatible blood unit दिनुअघि बिरामी पहिचानको कुन चरण अनिवार्य छ?",["Verify patient identity against the request and specimen labels","Rely only on bed number","Use another patient's previous group","Skip bedside checks"],0,"Positive patient identification and correct specimen labelling are critical to prevent transfusion errors.","Transfusion त्रुटि रोक्न सही बिरामी पहिचान र नमुना label मिलाउनु अत्यन्त आवश्यक छ।","Blood Banking"],["Which laboratory practice best protects staff when handling potentially infectious specimens?","सम्भावित संक्रमित नमुना सम्हाल्दा कर्मचारीलाई सबैभन्दा राम्रो सुरक्षा दिने अभ्यास कुन हो?",["Use appropriate PPE and standard precautions","Recap used needles by hand","Pipette by mouth","Work with open wounds"],0,"Standard precautions, suitable PPE, hand hygiene and safe sharps handling reduce occupational exposure.","Standard precaution, उपयुक्त PPE, हात सफाइ र सुरक्षित sharps handling ले संक्रमणको जोखिम घटाउँछ।","Laboratory Safety"]];
